TrackMe 1.8.0

• The map matches your theme, and now tilts to follow your direction as you ride.

• Pause or finish a ride from the notification. On Android 16 it appears in the status bar too.

• Ending a ride tells you one clear thing instead of two contradictory ones.

• Settings rebuilt. History cards, warnings and ride details are clearer throughout.

Tracking, group rides, sync and export are unchanged.
